# Freeze: PL Server and Online Cloud

PL Server/local sharing and online/cloud company behavior are stabilized. Do not casually change these flows.

Preserve:
- PL Server/local-first company sharing stays separate from online/cloud company routing.
- PL Server invite/access-token/auth, host/client delta sync, port registry, LAN relay, and attachment delta behavior remain unchanged.
- Online Firestore/Firebase company sync, cloud upload, write gateway, and cloud attachment behavior remain unchanged unless the user explicitly asks for online/cloud work.

Do not:
- refactor, rename, clean up, or drive-by edit PL Server/local sharing code
- mix Google Drive sync changes into PL Server or online/cloud behavior
- route PL Server companies through online/cloud code
- route online companies through PL Server/local server code

If a change is explicitly requested, keep it minimal and verify that PL Server/local sharing and online/cloud behavior remain separate.
